WEBVTT

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:32.597
by people they know
and by complete strangers.

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:36.663
These judgments probably don't reflect
what's best for the kids.

00:12:36.697 --> 00:12:40.663
How could they, given how profoundly
parenting has varied around the world

00:12:40.663 --> 00:12:42.297
and across time?

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:45.130
And given how the same parents
can shape children

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:47.830
under the same roof
in such different ways.

00:12:48.663 --> 00:12:52.397
Even when parents try their best,
they can't satisfy everybody.

00:12:52.863 --> 00:12:54.897
There's only so much time.

00:12:56.663 --> 00:13:00.663
This is especially true
for dragon parents.